 beginning with `http` are not mistaken for links.\n- **Improved experiment tracking and integrations:** Integration settings are read for each training run. W&B fixes improve final plot logging, offline resume IDs, project/run naming, and cleanup after interrupted or failed runs.\n- **Documentation and workflow updates:** Guides clarify validation image geometry, W&B usage, Platform export options, and contribution testing advice. CI failure alerts are centralized, and runner images regain dependencies needed for Codecov signature checks.\n\n## 🎯 Purpose & Impact\n- **SAM users** can provide prompts once and get the intended segmentation behavior throughout a folder or video, whether using Python, streaming, or the CLI.\n- **Training and deployment users** should see fewer failures on Intel NPUs and dynamic-output ONNX models, while checkpoint resumes and very short runs behave more reliably.\n- **Everyday prediction workflows** handle phone-camera images and mixed source lists more predictably.\n- **No new model architecture is introduced** in this release; the emphasis is on more dependable prediction, training, export, integrations, and documentation.\n\n## What's Changed\n* Name Platform export options and update the contributing guide's test advice by @glenn-jocher in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26659\n* Fix dynamic OpenVINO exports failing to compile on the Intel NPU by @onuralpszr in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26656\n* Centralize workflow failure alerts in the GitHub App by @glenn-jocher in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26661\n* Restore Codecov signature dependencies in runner images by @glenn-jocher in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26662\n* Add https://youtu.be/TBEPfu2IMXE to docs by @RizwanMunawar in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26649\n* Download only http(s) URLs in prediction source lists by @raimbekovm in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26660\n* Preserve RMSprop second moments when saving checkpoints by @Vaishnavi220506 in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26652\n* Apply EXIF orientation to PIL prediction inputs by @Nikhi00718 in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26650\n* Take at least one optimizer step in runs shorter than the accumulation interval by @raimbekovm in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26663\n* Fix ONNX GPU binding for symbolic output shapes by @aswanth-07 in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26657\n* Fix W&B final plots, resume id, project and run names, and failed-run cleanup by @raimbekovm in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26654\n* Document rectangular validation geometry in val mode docs by @lu123bing in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26653\n* Read integration settings per trainer and keep the events session id off the seeded RNG by @raimbekovm in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26658\n* 8.4.177 Fix SAM prompts across images and video frames by @8rulerstar in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26651\n\n## New Contributors\n* @lu123bing made their first contribution in https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/pull/26653\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/compare/v8.4.176...v8.4.177\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ultralytics/ultralytics/releases/411838538/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":9},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ultralytics/ultralytics/releases/410964449","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ultralytics/ultralytics/releases/410964449/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/ultralytics/ultralytics/releases/410964449/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/releases/tag/v8.4.176","id":410964449,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MD